OL,3,GNEWSABrewery founders hand control of
OL,4,Abusiness to staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founders of a brewery have handed
OL,7,Fover control of the business to
OL,8,Femployees in an attempt to secure its
OL,9,Ffuture.
OL,11,FThe Rebellion Beer Company, in Marlow,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, which supplies chef
OL,13,FTom Kerridge's restaurants, has
OL,14,Ftransferred the books to an Employee
OL,15,FOwnership Trust (EOT), which means the
OL,16,Fbrewery will be managed by its staff.
OL,18,FFounders Tim Coombes and Mark Gloyens
OL,19,Fmade the decision amid growing
OL,20,Funcertainty in the brewing industry,
OL,21,Ffollowing recent closures and threats
OL,22,Fof closure elsewhere in the sector.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
